note right of SpatialBoundaryEdge
  <b>Darboux Triad Orthogonality:</b>
  * <b>t</b> = unit boundary tangent
  * <b>r</b> = unit radial normal
  * <b>n_h</b> = normalize(t x r)
  * <n_h, r> = 0 (Zero vertical leakage)
  * <n_h, t> = 0 (In-plane edge normal)
  * ||n_h|| = 1.0 (Unit norm)
end note

note right of BoundaryFacetFluxLedger
  <b>Thermodynamic Governance:</b>
  * Mass Flux: Phi_M = (J_M . n_h) * L * dz
  * Antisymmetry: Phi_ij = -Phi_ji
  * Entropy Dissipation:
    dot{S} = L * dz * kappa * (T_i - T_j)^2 / (T_i * T_j * d) >= 0
end note

